    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII helper that records span start on construction and span end on destruction. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">TraceContext<sp/>ctx<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="structthemis_1_1modules_1_1_trace_context_1ac231782052d1c7d5cdca7db9323bbba8" kindref="member">TraceContext::generate</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;module_loader.loadModule&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_scoped_span_1aa86229632eab4feca538a147ee7ba5c6" kindref="member">ScopedSpan</ref><sp/>span(ctx,<sp/>emitter);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>do<sp/>work<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>if<sp/>an<sp/>error<sp/>occurred,<sp/>mark<sp/>it<sp/>before<sp/>destruction:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">span.setError(BASE_LOADER_INIT_FAILED::code,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;init<sp/>returned<sp/>-1&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>destructor<sp/>emits<sp/>span-end<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>error<sp/>detail</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_scoped_span" kindref="compound">ScopedSpan</ref> is non-copyable, non-movable. It must not outlive the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1modules_1aeaed24bd4fe681b9068c80da5239c1f3" kindref="member">SpanEmitter</ref></computeroutput> reference it holds. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
